[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3762161563","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/115048#issuecomment-3762161563","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115048","id":3762161563,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7gPgeb","user":{"login":"lordzsolt","id":8976891,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg5NzY4OTE=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/8976891?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/lordzsolt","html_url":"https://github.com/lordzsolt","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lordzsolt/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lordzsolt/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lordzsolt/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lordzsolt/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lordzsolt/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lordzsolt/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lordzsolt/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lordzsolt/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lordzsolt/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-01-16T23:02:32Z","updated_at":"2026-01-17T00:42:16Z","body":"Also happens in 4.5.stable\n\nI did some digging, and it happens because both the `CameraAttributes` base class and `CameraAttributesPhysical` / `CameraAttributesPractical` perform `ADD_GROUP(\"Auto Exposure\", \"auto_exposure_\");`\n\nI renamed them in my screenshot, to better illustrate my point:\n<img width=\"2200\" height=\"843\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/e37f2e8b-24ec-42ff-881c-e8fec0403c69\" />\n<img width=\"259\" height=\"977\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/71334542-c52f-4a7c-b1ef-d7fbe2dd6ec5\" />\n\nI suppose one option could be to move the properties from the derived class up to the base class, declare virtual functions for `auto_exposure_min` / `auto_exposure_max` and then use `_validate_property` to modify the hints.\n\nNot sure if a maintainer has a better solution. \n\n-----------\n\nAlternatively, it's probably just better drop some of the code in the base class, and duplicate them in the derived classes.\nI will try to open a PR with that to see what people think.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3762161563/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":1},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3763022537","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/115048#issuecomment-3763022537","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115048","id":3763022537,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7gSyrJ","user":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-0